## What the loop learned

The point of this file. Tick what was actually done, with the artifact:

- [ ] **Eval added** — `evals/cases/incident-<slug>.json` reproduces the failure; it stays in the suite as a regression test
- [ ] **CLAUDE.md line** — if an agent made or missed this, the correction added under *Things Claude gets wrong*: "<line>"
- [ ] **Band tuned** — `.factory/bands.yaml` metric / threshold adjusted, or a new metric that would have caught this earlier
- [ ] **Guard promoted** — a rule → hook / CI check so the class cannot recur (name it)
- [ ] **Runbook** — rollback or mitigation step added or corrected

## Open questions

What is still not understood, and who owns finding out.
